  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Today is Leo's birthday. Leo is eight. \"Happy birthday, Leo!\" says Mia. \"Thank you!\" says Leo. Mia has three toys. \"One robot.\" \"One teddy.\" \"One train.\" \"Wow!\" says Leo.",
      "Mom has food. \"Look, burgers!\" says Leo. \"How many burgers?\" asks Mom. Leo counts. \"One, two, three, four!\" \"Four burgers!\" \"Yes, four,\" says Mom. Mom has a cake too. It is a big pink cake. \"How old are you?\" asks Mia. \"I am eight,\" says Leo.",
      "Leo eats a burger. Mia eats cake. \"Is it good?\" asks Mom. \"Yes! It is very good!\" Leo plays with the robot. Mia plays with the train. They have fun."
    ],
